## CQ-NSM-01
@group Client
@commands New world: JEI search `@creativeequipment`, `@creativemagic`, `@creativecompat`; hover each moved item; WTHIT on the box, Dark Fire, pot and a sticky note; the shield and canned golem colours
@pass Every moved item has its name, model and texture (no purple-black, no raw lang key) and lists under its new mod; tier shields render their pattern base; canned golems show their dye color
@fails Missing texture: an asset path still under `creativeengineering` (`python3 tools/id_owner_lint.py`)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
do {"tooltip_text": "creativeequipment:copper_shield", "reject": "item\\.creativeengineering"}
do {"tooltip_text": "creativemagic:flint_and_terrasteel", "reject": "item\\.creativeengineering"}
do {"tooltip_text": "creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box", "reject": "block\\.creativeengineering"}
do {"wait": "jei"}
do {"screen": "creative:creativeequipment"}
shot equipment_tab
do {"screen": "close"}
